"""mradio — a colorful TUI radio player that uses mpv as its engine.

Usage: mradio [stream-url]              play (defaults to VCR1)
       mradio --version | --help | --settings
Keys: q quit · space pause · + / - volume · m mute · r reconnect · o open article
      z expand/collapse the full trivia text (or click it) · 1/2/3 pick AI provider
      p toggle dark/light palette
Config: self-contained in ~/.local/share/mradio/ (settings.json, config.json,
        cache.json). No shell rc files needed — env vars only optional overrides.
"""

